/obj/item/paper{
	info = "Between our own blast mining and the shifting layers of rock, seismic activity whether it be quakes or splitting terrain are a danger all personnel on site should be keenly aware of and watch out for the warning signs of an upcoming event. It is heavily advised all personnel wear their jaunt devices in event of accidental falls. You'd much rather deal with the nausea of a rapid bluespace relocation over the alternative of whatever lies below a chasm.";
